[2.125, "o", "Resident profile: age band 60-64, lives in Woodlands (North region, hazy today: yes), screening risk High, conditions: elevated blood glucose, about 3100 steps a day.\r\n"]
[2.125, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.125, "o", "Plan my week: what to eat for my glucose, and one indoor morning activity near Woodlands.\r\n"]
