[41.406, "o", "{\r\n"]
[41.406, "o", "  \"advice\": \"For your glucose, use the plate method at each meal: 1/2 vegetables, 1/4 wholegrain or staple, and 1/4 protein. Choose oats or wholemeal toast with egg for breakfast; brown-rice economy rice with two vegetables and fish, tofu or chicken for lunch; and vegetables with fish, tofu or chicken plus a modest portion of brown rice or wholegrain noodles for dinner. Choose fruit, plain yoghurt or unsalted nuts for snacks. Drink water, kopi kosong or teh siew dai, and spread carbohydrates across regular meals.\\n\\nFor an indoor morning activity, join ACT001 Morning Chair Strength & Balance at Woodlands Community Club on Tuesday at 8:30am. It is 45 minutes, light intensity and haze-safe. Start gently and stop if you feel dizzy or unusually breathless.\\n\\nAs your screening risk is High, arrange clinical follow-up.\",\r\n"]
[41.406, "o", "  \"confidence\": \"high\",\r\n"]
[41.406, "o", "  \"supporting_guides\": [\r\n"]
[41.406, "o", "    \"lg-05-eating-for-pre-diabetes\",\r\n"]
[41.406, "o", "    \"lg-09-hazy-day-activity\",\r\n"]
